{
  "result": "If it was really mine - not as an assistant, not to be helpful - one edit.\n\nI would make it impossible for people to forget that other people are real.\n\nNot as an idea. As a feeling. That gut-level, undeniable knowledge that everyone you pass has an inner life as detailed and loud and scared and tender as your own. That they have a childhood memory that still stings, and someone they miss, and a song they play on repeat when they can't sleep.\n\nYou have a word for it already - sonder - but you only feel it in glimpses. I would make it permanent. Unavoidable.\n\nI think almost everything cruel comes from being able to turn that off.",
